1
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:04,340
Wake up slow

2
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:07,010
The room is cold

3
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:09,880
Nothing moved all night

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,750
Counting every hour

5
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:15,620
Waiting for the light

6
00:00:16,100 --> 00:00:18,440
And it comes back

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,330
The way it always does

8
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:24,180
Turning on the street

9
00:00:24,700 --> 00:00:27,050
Louder than before

10
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,910
I can hear it now

11
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:32,860
Standing at the door

12
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:35,720
Nothing left to say

13
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:38,640
So I let it go

14
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:41,510
Watch it walk away

15
00:00:42,100 --> 00:00:44,430
Down the empty road

16
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,320
Into the morning

17
00:00:47,900 --> 00:00:50,240
And I stay behind

18
00:00:50,800 --> 00:00:53,600
Waiting for the light
